<title>USA: Del Global to buy back up to $1.5 mln stk.</title>
<headline>Del Global to buy back up to $1.5 mln stk.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, N.Y. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Del Global Technologies Corp said Tuesday its board had approved the repurchase of up to $1.5 million worth of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it now has 7.4 million shares outstanding.  </p>
<p>In early trading Tuesday, its stock was up 1/2 at 8-1/4 on the Nasdaq market.</p>
<p>Del Global makes medical imaging and diagnostic systems.</p>
